    <string name="terms_body">Welcome to yeex. By using the app you agree to follow the community guidelines, avoid posting offensive or unlawful content, and respect other users\' privacy. Content you post remains yours, but you grant us a license to display it within the app. The yeex team reserves the right to suspend or close any account that violates these terms. These terms may be updated from time to time, and you\'ll be notified of any material changes.</string>
